                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Base cost = pizza price × number of pizzas</li>
                                        <li>Topping cost = topping price × number of toppings</li>
                                        <li>Subtotal = base cost + topping cost</li>
                                        <li>Tax amount = subtotal × tax rate</li>
                                        <li>Total = subtotal + tax amount</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>
                                <li>Print all the values with proper formatting</li>
                                <li>Use <strong>at least 3 different operators</strong> (+, *, %, etc.)</li>
